{"unit_id":"LessXi__dsh-fluid-width#card-zh","repo":"LessXi/dsh-fluid-width","commit":"64a19ed9f665f2f0b23ccd99b7cf05ac922787cd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fluid-width 是一个面向 DSH Web GUI 的界面插件，让聊天显示区随浏览器窗口宽度伸缩，并在超宽布局下将内容宽度限制在 2000px。它通过 client 插件向页面加入 CSS 覆盖，同时监听页面样式变化，将聊天宽度变量中的像素定值改为自适应表达式。聊天列、输入区和使用该变量的内容因此可利用更宽的屏幕空间。插件不改侧边栏或右侧面板的宽度，也不需要 API 密钥或外部服务。适合希望改善 DSH Web 宽屏聊天阅读体验的用户；封顶值可在客户端源码中调整。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:27-32","lib/client.js:45-78"]}
{"unit_id":"LessXi__dsh-fluid-width#card-en","repo":"LessXi/dsh-fluid-width","commit":"64a19ed9f665f2f0b23ccd99b7cf05ac922787cd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-fluid-width makes the DSH Web chat area expand with the browser window, capped at 2000px. It adds a client-side CSS override and watches page styles, replacing pixel values for the chat width variable with a responsive expression. It needs no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:27-32","lib/client.js:45-78"]}
