{"unit_id":"LessXi__dsh-fluid-width#feature-responsive-width","repo":"LessXi/dsh-fluid-width","commit":"64a19ed9f665f2f0b23ccd99b7cf05ac922787cd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fluid-width 的功能「聊天区自适应宽度」：插件在 DSH Web 页面加入样式，将聊天宽度设为窗口可用宽度，并以 2000px 封顶。页面既有和后续注入的样式都会处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:27-42","lib/client.js:45-73"]}
{"unit_id":"LessXi__dsh-fluid-width#feature-cleanup","repo":"LessXi/dsh-fluid-width","commit":"64a19ed9f665f2f0b23ccd99b7cf05ac922787cd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fluid-width 的功能「样式监听清理」：插件监听页面样式新增或文本变化并改写聊天宽度；卸载 client 插件时会断开监听并移除自身加入的样式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:57-78"]}
{"unit_id":"LessXi__dsh-fluid-width#feature-tunable-cap","repo":"LessXi/dsh-fluid-width","commit":"64a19ed9f665f2f0b23ccd99b7cf05ac922787cd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fluid-width 的功能「调整宽度上限」：维护者可修改客户端中的 MAX_WIDTH_PX 常量，改变聊天内容最大宽度；当前默认值为 2000px。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:27-29"]}
